<Simple locale="en" routeKey="privacy" title="Privacy" description="How we handle your data." eyebrow="Your data"
  paragraphs={[
    'The details you share through the registration or contact form (name, email address, phone number and your message) are used only to handle your registration or question and to send you practical information. We do not pass them on to third parties and do not use them for newsletters unless you explicitly ask for that.',
    'This website sets no tracking or advertising cookies. The map on the location page is loaded from OpenStreetMap; your IP address is passed to OpenStreetMap in the process, as with any website that shows a map.',
    'You can always ask which data we hold about you, have it corrected or deleted. Email jessica@embraceevolve.com for this.',
    'Data controller: Jessica Abicht, Bredabaan 1251, 2930 Brasschaat, Belgium, VAT BE 0469.998.256.',
  ]} />
